# A `$word` that arrives in a paste and names a skill opens the menu on it
# (maybeOpenPastedSkillMenu, input_paste_runtime.zig:634-663).
fx: work skills-ws-fx
xfx: work skills-ws-xfx
wait 3
paste use $rel please
wait 1.5
snap paste
key Enter
wait 0.5
snap paste-enter
key C-u
wait 0.3
paste no $zzz here
wait 1
snap paste-nomatch
